'''Teddiursa''' (Japanese: '''ヒメグマ''' ''Himeguma'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

