==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Skyridge|Teddiursa|109}} from the {{TCG|Skyridge}} expansion.
*'''Surprise Attack''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Brock's Diglett|67}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

